      "content": "a quiet space isn't enough. i'm still stuck in this life, still seeing their faces every single day, still feeling the shame of it. it’s like i'm trapped in a loop of being nothing. i just want the noise to stop. i want the feeling of being a ghost to actually be real, so i don't have to feel the friction of being alive anymore. it feels like there's no way to actually escape the social debt i've been handed.",
